{"id":"msg_m_ex_noir_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_noir","label":"Noir · Nikke"},"label":"3. Pit Boss,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_noir_02","next":"msg_m_ex_noir_04","speakers":{"noir":"Noir"},"icons":{"noir":"si_c271_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_1","text":"Pit Boss,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_2","text":"I was walking through the park,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_3","text":"and a guy who said he was a fan asked me for a handshake.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_4","text":"And?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_5","text":"It's just that...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_6","text":"I was so shy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_7","text":"that I ended up apologizing","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_8","text":"and running away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_9","text":":'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_10","text":"I could see the disappointment in his eyes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_11","text":"When I think about it, I feel so bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_12","text":"Do you think there's any way I could make it up to him?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_13","text":"Unless you're able to track that person down, it's going to be pretty difficult.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_14","text":"I thought so too...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_15","text":"Ugh, why am I always like this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_16","text":"Do you think there is a way to fix this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_17","text":"I already know that if this happened tomorrow, I'd do the exact same thing again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_18","text":"Just imagine that the person in front of you is me.","jump":"m_ex_noir_03_20"},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_19","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_19","text":"Just envision the person in front of you as a rock.","jump":"m_ex_noir_03_25"},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_20","text":"Erm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_21","text":"I don't know...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_22","text":"I think that'd only make me more nervous :/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_23","text":"Having said that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_24","text":"I do feel awfully comfortable whenever I'm talking to you...","jump":"m_ex_noir_03_30"},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_25","text":"A rock?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_26","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_27","text":"I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_28","text":"I could talk to a rock no problem!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_29","text":"It's not like a rock has feelings, after all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_30","text":"I think this method might just work out!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_31","text":"It's settled, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_32","text":"If anyone approaches me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_33","text":"I'll do exactly what you said.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_34","text":"Then I won't be flustered.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_35","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_36","text":"at least not AS flustered, anyway.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_37","text":"And I won't leave them feeling disappointed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_38","text":"I'm positive this will work.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_39","text":"Oooh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_40","text":"Thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_41","text":"Actually...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_42","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_43","text":"If you're so nervous around people, how do you manage to perform in front of a massive crowd so often?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_44","text":"Oh, that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_45","text":"It's all because of Blanc.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_46","text":"As long as we're together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_47","text":"I can do it too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_48","text":"How should I put it...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_49","text":"Once I'm on stage, I feel like I'm someone else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_50","text":"Someone brimming with confidence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_51","text":"Sounds to me like you're born to be on the stage.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_52","text":"Hehe, maybe you're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_53","text":"You're making me blush, Pit Boss...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_54","text":"Anyway, I can't keep going around snubbing my devoted fans.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_55","text":"I've got to try harder!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_56","text":"I'll be cheering you on all the way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_57","text":"Thanks!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_58","text":"And thanks for listening to my story.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_03_59","text":"Anyway, you should get some rest!","jump":null}],"chat":true}